        },
        "description": "Named the king of Camelot after pulling a sword from the stone that hundreds of holy knights could not.\n\nArthur is a polite, young man who is still adjusting to his role as king. He takes his responsibilities very seriously, but usually undertakes them with a smile and has a very warm, and happy-go-lucky demeanor.\n\nHe marched toward the kingdom of Liones with an army of illusions created by [Merlin](https://anilist.co/character/89180/Merlin) in hopes of meeting with the king; however, he was confronted by [Hendricksen](https://anilist.co/character/86679/Hendricksen) who tried to kill him before [Meliodas](https://anilist.co/character/72921/Meliodas) came to his aide.",
